{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391668-exalted-writing-prompts","id":1391668,"title":"Exalted Writing Prompts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-26T05:13:43-07:00","id":1391668,"title":"Exalted Writing Prompts","content":"<ul><li><b>Solar: </b>A nigh-impossible (or fully impossible) heroic task and how a Solar did it anyways</li> <li><b>Lunar: </b>Choose an animal and write about a Lunar with that spirit shape</li> <li><b>Sidereal: </b>Choose an constellation and write about an unlikely resplendent destiny under that college</li> <li><b>Abyssal: </b>Choose an Abyssal name and how they died and came back</li> <li><b>Dragon Blooded: </b>Choose a tasty morsel of Imperial City gossip and tell the real story behind it</li> <li><b>Infernal: </b>Choose a Infernal Urge and the awful person following it</li> <li><b>Alchemical: </b>Choose an Alchemical name and caste and describe one of their custom charms</li> <li><b>God: </b>Choose something that could be a godly domain and write about the god of that domain</li> <li><b>Elemental: </b>Choose a natural phenomenon and the elementals tied to it</li> <li><b>Demon: </b>Choose an ordinary activity and how it's done in Malfeas</li> <li><b>Ghost: </b>Choose a cause of death and the ghost it produced</li> <li><b>Raksha: </b>&quot;Once upon a time, there was a Raksha who...&quot;</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T01:00:40-07:00","id":1393749,"title":"","content":"Hiroko, God of Inter-Exalt Relations, The Moderator<br /> <br /> '''Description:''' Hiroko appears to be an Exalt with no Breeding or Caste marks - young, powerful and confident. <br /> <br /> '''Concept:''' God of the dealings between Exalted types.<br /> <br /> '''Motivation:''' To promote harmony between the Exalted.<br /> <br /> '''Adventures:''' Hiroko once enjoyed heavenly life with a modest domain and the utopia Ambrosia can create. That is, until the Great Prophecy was cast. Hiroko was one of the first gods targeted in the Sidereal political offensive leading up to the Usurpation, due to his frequent role as moderator de-escalating Exalted disputes. The nascent Bronze Sidereals saw him as a tool propping up the corrupt Solar order.<br /> <br /> In the Second Age he has become an unemployed outcaste, his position in the Bureau of Humanity eliminated. Hiroko has been roaming the edge of Creation since his unemployment trying to get Outcastes and Lunars to cooperate. Not visiting the Blessed Isle for millenia, he has a somewhat dated view of the continent. He sees the return of the Solars as a great opportunity for his domain.<br /> <br /> He has found the Shard of an Eclipse Caste, currently residing in Balthazar who was once Keiga, who championed much of his outlook on Exaltation in the First Age. Hiroko has befriended the Solar in what is currently a mentor-mentee relationship and hopes the Solar can 'fix' the Celestial Bureaucracy to its 'proper' state, including him in his old position. The addition of the Abyssal and Infernal Exalted has expanded his nature in ways he has yet to fully understand.<br /> <br /> Hiroko rarely engages in combat, but vigorously engages in debates. <br /> <br /> '''Charm Modifications''' Worldly Illusion must target at least 2 different types of Exalts. This Charm takes participants to a courtyard in between a circle of manses, 1 for each type of Exalt.<br /> Measure the Wind has an extended range - Essence miles, but can only see Exalts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}